# Copy to .env.local (or .env) and fill in from your Supabase project (Project Settings → API).
# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code, and this file is gitignored — never
# commit real values. The anon key is safe to ship to the browser; RLS + the Express server's
# own authorization checks are what actually gate access.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
